  <History Date="05-07-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Corrected Atlabase ID for 18 channel mode.  Removed Classic Pearl Ref.  Added 11 channel rev 4 mode.  Added macros.  Minor revision to control function names for consistency.  Added product thumbnail." Version="5" />
